  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "9c7d33e5-2038-4c18-beef-3ceae9142b38",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1100,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 760,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## get_service_or_price_info (new)\n`POST /webhook/get-service-or-price-info`\n\n**Body:** `business_id`, `service_name`\n\nLooks up one service by a fuzzy (case-insensitive, partial) match against this business's own active services -- callers describe services in their own words (\"the beard thing\"), so an exact match would reject too much. Price is only ever returned in the shape the service's own `price_disclosure` allows (`exact`, `range`, or `not_disclosed`); this workflow never estimates a number that wasn't already in Supabase."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "09562526-2914-477a-9fb6-523e05047600",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1060,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "get-service-or-price-info",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "get-service-or-price-info-placeholder",
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_N8N_GATEWAY_HEADER_AUTH_CREDENTIAL",
          "name": "ReceptionFlow Gateway Shared Secret (placeholder)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "4fe80a44-7462-44e1-ba0e-a25ecc825723",
      "name": "Validate Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -840,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// get_service_or_price_info — Validate Input\nconst body = $input.first().json.body || {};\nconst businessId = String(body.business_id ?? '').trim();\nconst serviceName = String(body.service_name ?? body.service ?? '').trim();\n\nconst errors = [];\nif (!businessId) errors.push('business_id is required');\nif (!serviceName) errors.push('service_name is required');\n\n// PostgREST ilike wildcard match -- '*' is its wildcard character, and\n// this also escapes commas/parens that would otherwise be parsed as\n// PostgREST filter syntax.\nconst escaped = serviceName.replace(/[,()]/g, '');\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    valid: errors.length === 0,\n    errors,\n    business_id_input: businessId,\n    service_name: serviceName,\n    ilike_term: '*' + escaped + '*',\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c4a56b06-8099-48f1-81c3-ee26899e10b2",
